750.800 - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) (R) counter under coffee makers (coffee splash/debris);
B) (R) general surfaces inside the cappuccino machine (cappuccino mixes);
C) (R) bottom inside the ovens (carbon/debris); 
D) stove top drip trays (splash/debris);   and
E) 2 door freezer - bottom inside (food splash) 

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
